="43.154" end="43.394">The</span> <span begin="43.394" end="43.616">e</span><span begin="43.616" end="44.128">lec</span><span begin="44.128" end="44.331">tric</span> <span begin="44.331" end="44.490">pi</span><span begin="44.490" end="44.622">a</span><span begin="44.622" end="44.875">no</span> <span begin="44.875" end="45.292">whis</span><span begin="45.292" end="45.781">pers</span> <span begin="45.781" end="46.265">to</span> <span begin="46.265" end="46.522">the</span> <span begin="46.522" end="47.111">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">电钢琴在夜色中轻声细语</span></p><p begin="47.244" end="50.856" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.244" end="47.478">While</span> <span begin="47.478" end="47.733">we&apos;re</span> <span begin="47.733" end="47.984">ba</span><span begin="47.984" end="48.236">thing</span> <span begin="48.236" end="48.452">in</span> <span begin="48.452" end="48.700">the</span> <span begin="48.700" end="49.203">soft</span> <span begin="49.203" end="49.649">and</span> <span begin="49.649" end="50.148">sil</span><span begin="50.148" end="50.385">ver</span> <span begin="50.385" end="50.856">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当我们沉醉于那柔和如银的月光里</span></p><p begin="51.380" end="55.001" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.380" end="51.886">No</span> <span begin="51.886" end="52.082">more</span> <span begin="52.082" end="52.309">noise</span> <span begin="52.309" end="52.557">and</span> <span begin="52.557" end="53.036">no</span> <span begin="53.036" end="53.532">more</span> <span begin="53.532" end="53.786">ci</span><span begin="53.786" end="54.288">ty</span> <span begin="54.288" end="55.001">heat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">再无喧嚣，也无城市的燥热烦扰</span></p><p begin="55.001" end="1:01.063" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.001" end="55.241">Just</span> <span begin="55.241" end="55.491">the</span> <span begin="55.491" end="56.071">sound</span> <span begin="56.071" end="56.240">of</span> <span begin="56.240" end="56.903">two</span> <span begin="56.903" end="57.671">heart</span><span begin="57.671" end="57.922">s</span> <span begin="58.876" end="59.097">in</span> <span begin="59.097" end="59.301">a</span> <span begin="59.301" end="59.577">stea</span><span begin="59.577" end="59.862">dy</span> <span begin="59.862" end="1:01.063">beat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">唯有两颗心，在平稳的律动中紧紧相依</span></p><p begin="1:02.755" end="1:06.378" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.755" end="1:02.987">And</span> <span begin="1:02.987" end="1:03.235">the</span> <span begin="1:03.235" end="1:03.461">syn</span><span begin="1:03.461" end="1:03.701">the</span><span begin="1:03.701" end="1:03.946">si</span><span begin="1:03.946" end="1:04.189">zers</span> <span begin="1:04.189" end="1:04.686">float</span> <span begin="1:04.686" end="1:04.919">like</span> <span begin="1:04.919" end="1:05.156">a</span> <span begin="1:05.156" end="1:05.393">gen</span><span begin="1:05.393" end="1:05.868">tle</span> <span begin="1:05.868" end="1:06.378">mist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">合成器的音符如轻柔薄雾般漂浮流淌</span></p><p begin="1:06.378" end="1:10.237" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.378" end="1:06.588">In</span> <span begin="1:06.588" end="1:06.828">a</span> <span begin="1:06.828" end="1:07.338">mo</span><span begin="1:07.338" end="1:07.568">ment</span> <span begin="1:07.568" end="1:07.816">that</span> <span begin="1:07.816" end="1:08.058">was</span> <span begin="1:08.058" end="1:08.521">wai</span><span begin="1:08.521" end="1:09.014">ting</span> <span begin="1:09.014" end="1:09.273">to</span> <span begin="1:09.273" end="1:09.737">be</span> <span begin="1:09.737" end="1:10.237">kissed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">定格在这渴望被温柔亲吻的瞬间</span></p><p begin="1:10.237" end="1:13.341" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.237" end="1:10.468">The</span> <span begin="1:10.468" end="1:10.70