="1:23.981" end="1:24.256">the</span> <span begin="1:24.256" end="1:24.766">bu</span><span begin="1:24.766" end="1:25.211">sy</span> <span begin="1:25.211" end="1:25.704">day</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">飞越白日里那些纷乱嘈杂的回响</span></p><p begin="1:25.946" end="1:33.260" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.946" end="1:26.193">With</span> <span begin="1:26.193" end="1:26.430">a</span> <span begin="1:26.430" end="1:27.155">90s</span> <span begin="1:27.155" end="1:27.615">soul</span> <span begin="1:27.615" end="1:28.376">so</span> <span begin="1:28.376" end="1:28.842">mel</span><span begin="1:28.842" end="1:29.088">low</span> <span begin="1:29.088" end="1:29.570">and</span> <span begin="1:29.570" end="1:30.055">so</span> <span begin="1:30.055" end="1:33.260">true</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">带着九十年代灵魂那份醇厚与真挚</span></p><p begin="1:33.460" end="1:38.339" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.460" end="1:34.170">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:34.170" end="1:34.645">fin</span><span begin="1:34.645" end="1:34.902">ding</span> <span begin="1:34.902" end="1:35.416">e</span><span begin="1:35.416" end="1:35.843">very</span> <span begin="1:35.843" end="1:36.651">peace</span> <span begin="1:36.651" end="1:36.853">of</span> <span begin="1:36.853" end="1:37.336">mind</span> <span begin="1:37.336" end="1:37.849">in</span> <span begin="1:37.849" end="1:38.339">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我在你怀中，寻得了内心所有的安宁</span></p><p begin="1:57.132" end="2:00.799" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.132" end="1:57.430">The</span> <span begin="1:57.430" end="1:57.687">a</span><span begin="1:57.687" end="1:57.897">na</span><span begin="1:57.897" end="1:58.360">log</span> <span begin="1:58.360" end="1:58.846">warmth</span> <span begin="1:58.846" end="1:59.100">is</span> <span begin="1:59.100" end="1:59.341">a</span> <span begin="1:59.341" end="1:59.572">blan</span><span begin="1:59.572" end="1:59.825">ket</span> <span begin="1:59.825" end="2:00.074">for</span> <span begin="2:00.074" end="2:00.312">the</span> <span begin="2:00.312" end="2:00.799">soul</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">模拟信号的暖意，是包裹灵魂的绒毯</span></p><p begin="2:01.039" end="2:04.686" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.039" end="2:01.521">Ma</span><span begin="2:01.521" end="2:01.769">king</span> <span begin="2:01.769" end="2:02.003">e</span><span begin="2:02.003" end="2:02.261">very</span> <span begin="2:02.261" end="2:02.489">bro</span><span begin="2:02.489" end="2:02.709">ken</span> <span begin="2:02.709" end="2:02.949">part</span> <span begin="2:02.949" end="2:03.181">of</span> <span begin="2:03.181" end="2:03.453">me</span> <span begin="2:03.453" end="2:03.942">feel</span> <span begin="2:03.942" end="2:04.686">whole</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">抚平我每一处破碎，让我重获完整</span></p><p begin="2:04.686" end="2:09.565" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.686" end="2:05.145">No</span> <span begin="2:05.145" end="2:05.643">strings</span> <span begin="2:05.643" end="2:05.896">to</span> <span begin="2:05.896" end="2:06.347">pull</span> <span begin="2:06.347" end="2:06.835">just</span> <span begin="2:06.835" end="2:07.063">a</span> <span begin="2:07.063" end="2:07.330">har</span><span begin="2:07.330" end="2:07.565">mo</span><span begin="2:07.565" end="2:08.056">ny</span> <span begin="2:08.056" end="2:08.492">so</span> <span begin="2:08.492" end="2:09.565">deep</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无需任何牵绊，只有这份深沉的共鸣</span></p><p begin="2:10.236" end="2:13.141" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.236" end="2:10.449">A</span> <span begin="2:10.449" end="2:10.694">se</span><span begin="2:10.694" end="2:10.934">cret</span> <span begin="2:10.934" end="2:11.193">that</span> <span begin="2:11.193" end="2:11.425">the</span> <span begin="2:11.425" end="2:11.666">moon</span> <span begin="2:11.666" end="2:11.906">is</s